            "h": {
              "type": "_heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Pre-Orders",
                "heading_size": "h4"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "h"
          ]
        },
        "c5-q0": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is a pre-order?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>A pre-order allows you to secure an item before it officially ships or restocks.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c5-q1": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When will my pre-order ship?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Estimated shipping windows are listed clearly on the product page at the time of purchase.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c5-q2": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will I receive other items in my order sooner?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>If your order includes a pre-order item, your full order may ship together once all items are available unless otherwise stated.</p><p>If you&rsquo;d like an in-stock item shipped sooner, we can arrange a split shipment. A second shipping fee will apply. Please contact our team to set it up.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c5-q3": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can pre-order timelines change?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Occasionally, production or shipping delays can impact timelines. If anything changes significantly, we&rsquo;ll keep you updated by email.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "cat-6-brand-community": {
          "type": "heading-group",
          "settings": {
            "page_title": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "h": {
              "type": "_heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Brand & Community",
                "heading_size": "h4"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "h"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q0": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who founded Anxious Preoccupied?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Anxious Preoccupied was co-founded by Joanne McNally and Nikki Lannen.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q1": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Anxious Preoccupied?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We&rsquo;re an accessories brand creating personality-led bags and accessories designed for everyday chaos, overthinking and excellent outfits.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q2": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Anxious Preoccupied an Irish brand?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Yes, Anxious Preoccupied is proudly Irish designed.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q3": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I shop Anxious Preoccupied in person?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Selected styles are stocked through retail partners and pop-up locations throughout the year. Follow us on social for the latest updates and launches.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q4": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I contact customer support?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>You can reach us at <a href=\"mailto:hi@anxiouspreoccupied.com\" title=\"Email Anxious Preoccupied\">hi@anxiouspreoccupied.com</a> and our team will get back to you as soon as possible during business hours, Monday&ndash;Friday.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q5": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you collaborate with creators or brands?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We love hearing from aligned brands and creators. Partnership or collaboration enquiries can be sent via our contact email.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q6": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I stock Anxious Preoccupied in my store?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Wholesale enquiries are always welcome. Please contact us with details about your store and location.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q7": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer press samples or PR gifting?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>For press, gifting or media enquiries, please reach out to our team directly with relevant information and deadlines.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c6-q8": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I stay updated on launches and restocks?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Sign up to our newsletter and follow us on social media for first access to launches, restocks, events and emotionally charged product drops.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "cat-7-care-maintenance": {
          "type": "heading-group",
          "settings": {
            "page_title": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "h": {
              "type": "_heading",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Care & Maintenance",
                "heading_size": "h4"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "h"
          ]
        },
        "c7-q0": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the material water proof?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Our material offers light water resistance. To preserve its finish and longevity, we recommend avoiding prolonged contact with water or soaking.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c7-q1": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why does my bag look slightly misshapen when it arrives?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Your bag is packaged in a box for protection and may arrive slightly out of shape. Simply let it sit for a day or two and it will return to its original form.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c7-q2": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long can the bag stay under the sun?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We recommend avoiding prolonged direct sunlight or high heat, especially when the bag is not in use. Short periods are fine, but extended exposure can lead to damage.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        },
        "c7-q3": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What temperatures should be avoided?",
            "font_style": "heading h6",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {
            "txt": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Avoid exposing the bag to extreme heat or extreme cold. High temperatures can soften or warp materials, while very cold conditions may make them less flexible. Store and use your bag in moderate temperatures whenever possible.</p>",
                "font_style": "body"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "txt"
          ]
        }
